    "description": "<b>Messages App to stay connected securely with your friends and family using Apps Specials easy-to-use SMS and MMS messaging app. Join over 16 million users already benefiting from our smart, fast, and secure SMS message app.</b>\r\n\r\nUsing a built-in SMS Organizer to organize all text messages, chats or conversations automatically into Personal, Transactions, OTPs and Offers categories.\r\n\r\nGet benefits from the messages app to enhance your SMS text messaging experience. Express yourself with emojis and stickers, schedule message, block unwanted contacts, and backup & restore your conversations and much more.\r\n\r\n\r\n\u258c<b>Here are the Features of the SMS, MMS Messaging App:</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Customize Notification Alert</b> \ud83e\udd70\r\nTake control of your notifications of an Android messages app for individual contacts and chats. Customize notifications preview, ringtone, wake screen, vibrate, and DND settings for a personalized experience.\r\n\r\n<b>Schedule Messages</b> \ud83d\ude0e\r\n- The Easy, Smart, and Cool message app provides a schedule message feature to schedule SMS and deliver at the exact time & date you wish. \r\n\r\n- Easily schedule birthday SMS Message, work-related SMS reminders, etc., in advance.\r\n\r\n<b>SMS Backup and Restore</b> \ud83d\udd03\r\nSecurely take a backup of your SMS or Conversations into your internal storage and restore it whenever you want with just one click.\r\n\r\n<b>Delivery Confirmation</b> \ud83d\ude1c\r\nThe SMS messaging app delivery confirmation feature provides peace of mind by ensuring that your message has been successfully sent.\r\n\r\n<b>Auto Delete Conversation</b> \ud83d\ude0d\r\nKeep your message inbox clutter-free using Auto Delete Conversation. You don\u2019t need to select a message or chat one by one. The free SMS and MMS messaging app will do it automatically.\r\n\r\n<b>Emojis, Stickers & GIFs</b> \ud83e\udd29\r\nThe messages app allows you to use expressive emojis, a variety of stickers, and GIFs to enhance your message. Send emojis, stickers, and GIFs in your SMS text messages to express yourself better.\r\n\r\n<b>Swipe Actions</b> \ud83d\udc48\r\n - With our customizable quick swipe actions feature, Keep your inbox messages organized. You have the power to tailor your interactions exactly how you like them. \r\n\r\n- Whether you prefer to swipe left or right, choose actions like archive, delete, call, or mark messages as read or unread, the choice is yours.\r\n\r\n<b>Block Contacts</b> \ud83d\udeab\r\nKeep your messaging experience free from distractions by blocking contacts with a simple tap. Enjoy a clutter-free messages inbox and experience peace of mind.\r\n\r\n<b>Voice Calls</b> \ud83d\udcde\r\nStay connected with friends and family through crystal-clear voice calls alongside your SMS message with just a tap.\r\n\r\nThis Message app is designed to support all popular devices such as Samsung, Xiaomi, Google, Motorola, Redmi, Oppo, Vivo, etc. Fast simple Messaging App also supports all Android Versions like Android versions 7, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13, and 14.\r\n\r\nConnect with friends, stay organized, read messages, and express yourself like never before. Upgrade your messaging game today with our Smart & Fast Messages app!\r\n\r\nMessages, an all-in-one smart, secure and fast messages app. Send and receive messages offline. Experience the most popular message app for yourself by downloading it now.\r\n\r\nSupport: We always strive to improve our Messaging App, have any issues or suggestions about the SMS Message app, then contact us via mail.",
